Definition:
==========
A-T-Scarlet-sword is one of the cool swords in the cartoon
I've made it with Inkscape and GIMP

I hope you like it.

Size:
=====
36x36.


Installation:
=============
copy A-T-Scarlet-sword-cursor to ~/.icons directory
cp -a A-T-Scarlet-sword-cursor ~/.icons

